<title>USA: Alcan ups US price 2 cents to 82 cents/lb. [CORRECTED 08:34 GMT  2/8]</title>
<headline>Alcan ups US price 2 cents to 82 cents/lb. [CORRECTED 08:34 GMT  2/8]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcan Aluminium of Canada raised its U.S.  list price for ingot by 2 (corrects from 3) cents to 82 cents a lb,  effective Aug. 1.</p>
<p>The list price for extrusion billet was raised the same to 92 cents,  effective the same date.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1646))</p>
</text>
